<title>UK: Bankers Trust sets warrants on four currency pairs.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets warrants on four currency pairs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Effecten GmbH has issued 300,000 warrants, on the mark/dollar, Swiss franc/dollar, yen/dollar and yen/mark, lead manager Bankers Trust International said.</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     4.0 DEM</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	18..JUL.97		PAYDATE	07.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   BERLIN, FFURT, DUSS, HAMBURG, STUTTGART</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>	   DEM/DLR	 CHF/DLR	 YEN/DLR	 YEN/DEM</p>
<p> SPOT    1.5555	  1.3280	  113.80	  73.185</p>
<p> RANGES  1.600-1.4800  1.360-1.260   117.0-109.0   75.50-71.0</p>
<p> NOTES	     -</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
